ocsfs (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Phase 0: FUSE prototype with full on-disk format.
  * Phase 1: Linux kernel module — single-node read/write with crash recovery.
  * Phase 2: Multi-node clustering — DLM, heartbeat, SCSI PR, recovery.
  * Phase 3: Performance — iomap, direct I/O, preallocation, thin provisioning.
  * Phase 4: Advanced features — CoW snapshots, compression, Proxmox VE plugin.
  * Phase 5: Production packaging — Debian packages, systemd, man pages.

 -- OCSFS Project <ocsfs@example.org>  Tue, 18 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
